+<pre>Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF)                     D. Hardt, Ed.
+Request for Comments: 6749                                     Microsoft
+Obsoletes: <a href="./rfc5849">5849</a>                                             October 2012
+Category: Standards Track
+ISSN: 2070-1721
